  "description": "On 2024-11-05T09:23:15Z, a new ticket was created in the AcmeSupport system under the account **acme_corp**. The request, titled **\u201cUnable to process payment on checkout\u201d**, was logged as an **Incident** with **High** priority and currently has an **Open** status. It is associated with **Acme Corporation** (organization ID **98765**) and carries the tags **billing,urgent**. The external reference is **EXT-12345**. The ticket is assigned to the **Support_Tier_2** group, was submitted **via web**, and is slated to be resolved by **2024-11-12T17:00:00Z**. The most recent update occurred on **2024-11-06T14:45:30Z**, and the ticket can be accessed at **https://support.acme.com/tickets/102394**.\n\nThe latest internal comment, added by **Alice Johnson**, reads: \u201cWe\u2019ve identified the root cause and are working on a fix.\u201d This comment is marked as **private** (not public). The ticket was logged during business hours, and the CC list includes **John Doe, Jane Smith**.",
